e site; paths and sections may be affected by maintenance, permitted events, or temporary closures.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"renwick-gallery","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Renwick Gallery","title":"Explore Craft at the Renwick","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Free American craft near the White House","notes":"Enter at Pennsylvania Avenue and focus on one gallery floor; use the 17th Street ramp if step-free access is needed.","short_summary":"Add a manageable indoor art stop without leaving the Foggy Bottom area far behind.","evidence_claim":"The Smithsonian lists the Renwick Gallery as a contemporary American craft museum open daily from 10 a.m. to 5:30 p.m., free with no pass required.","source_url":"https://www.si.edu/museums/renwick-gallery","source_title":"Renwick Gallery of the Smithsonian American Art Museum | Smithsonian Institution","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open daily 10 a.m.–5:30 p.m.; closed December 25. No pass is required, and the accessible entrance is at 17th Street.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lafayette-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Lafayette Park","title":"View the White House From Lafayette Park","subtitle":"Saturday late afternoon · Public space and presidential history","notes":"Walk the park’s perimeter, identify the surrounding historic buildings, and use the north side for a public White House view.","short_summary":"Connect a familiar national landmark to the history of its surrounding public square.","evidence_claim":"The National Park Service identifies Lafayette Park as a seven-acre park directly north of the White House with a long history of public gatherings.","source_url":"https://www.nps.gov/places/000/lafayette-park.htm","source_title":"Lafayette Park (U.S. National Park Service)","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2025-07-19","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The park is a public outdoor space, but the National Park Service warns that Secret Service closures may occur without advance notice.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gw-university-student-center-study-space","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"University Student Center Study Spaces","title":"Close the Weekend With a Campus Reset","subtitle":"Sunday evening · Plan the week from a familiar hub","notes":"Return to the ground- or fourth-floor study areas, review Monday’s route, and check GW Engage for upcoming campus activities.","short_summary":"Finish where the sequence began, now with enough context to plan the first week.","evidence_claim":"GW states that study spaces of varying sizes are available on the ground and fourth floors of the University Student Center.","source_url":"https://students.gwu.edu/university-student-center","source_title":"University Student Center | Division for Student Affairs | The George Washington University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"On August 13, 2026, summer hours are 7 a.m.–9 p.m. daily through August 16, with GWorld tap access required after 6 p.m.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["The first and final cards use distinct named subjects within the same building: the University Student Center as an orientation hub and its officially identified study spaces as the closing activity.","Hours and temporary-access conditions should be rechecked immediately before visiting, particularly for the Student Center, Smith Center events, Lafayette Park, and Kennedy Center spaces."]}],"warnings":[]}
